{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10211023","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10211023","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1021102301:0":{"text":"이제 해독만 남았네. 멜리사, 이건 역사적인 순간이야! ","source_cn":"接下来就只差解读工作了，梅丽莎，这简直是历史性的一刻！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CD826AA0AFA216C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1021102302:0":{"text":"오, 듀라 님! 드디어 오랜 연구의 종지부가 보이네요. 이번에는 연구 보고서의 글자수를 채우느라 고생하지 않아도 되겠어요... ","source_cn":"艾雅在上，长久以来的跋涉终于有所收获，我不用在研究报告...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58B557F8A7D1C437","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1021102303:0":{"text":"마법사<male>님</male><female>님</female>, 도와주셔서 정말 감사해요!","source_cn":"魔法师<male>先生</male><female>小...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3F503ED0299CAD14","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마법사<male>님</male><female>님</female>, 도와주셔서 정말 감사해요!","female":"마법사<male>님</male><female>님</female>, 도와주셔서 정말 감사해요!","variant_male_record_index":"100397","variant_female_record_index":"100398","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1021102304:0":{"text":"...저기, 멜리사? 탐험기에 혹시 버튼 얘기가 있었나?","source_cn":"……我说，梅丽莎，探险记事里有提过这里有个按钮吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36B630A3D2A486CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1021102305:0":{"text":"누르지 마!","source_cn":"不要碰！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh